[I] Framework for audio analysis and feature extraction

[T] The Vamp plugin SDK provides the API and helper libraries for writing
[T] Vamp plugins and hosts in C and C++. Vamp plugins process sampled audio
[T] data to produce descriptive output such as measurements or semantic
[T] observations, and are used by Sonic Visualiser and Audacity.

[U] https://vamp-plugins.org/

[A] Vamp-sdk Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

